# size 20x5
# Resizing while a full-screen program owns the terminal, then leaving it.
#
# The primary screen is full and the resize makes it shorter, so lines have to move into the
# scrollback when it comes back. Without that, an emulator that never reflows the primary screen
# on exit looks identical to one that does, because short content in a tall screen survives either
# way. Short lines still, so reflow itself is not in question - tmux does not reflow.
\e[H\e[2Jshell-one\r\nshell-two\r\nshell-three\r\nshell-four\r\nshell-five
\e[?1049h\e[H\e[2Jfullscreen-app
# resize 12x3
\e[?1049l
